            </div>
            <ul class="checklist-list">
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Last 12 months of bank statements for all accounts (both parties)</li>
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Property ownership documents (title deeds, Dubai Land Department registration)</li>
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Vehicle registration certificates</li>
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Business ownership documents, share certificates, or trade licence if applicable</li>
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Employment contracts and recent payslips (both parties)</li>
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Pension and investment account statements</li>
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Mahr certificate or nikah contract confirming agreed mahr amount</li>
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Any prenuptial or postnuptial agreement (attested and translated)</li>
