              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> School records and medical records for children (custody cases)</li>
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Updated bank statements if financial position has changed since filing</li>
              <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> Evidence of any domestic abuse, parental alienation, or misconduct (if pleaded)</li>
